        "product_summary": "Wide toe shape: A widened forefoot outline is paired with a rounded toe in this casual sock-style shoe.\n\nSlip-on knit upper: A continuous knitted entry and rear pull loop define the pull-on construction without laces.\n\nVisible knit zones: Larger mesh-like openings across the front combine with denser knit patterns around the side and heel.\n\nSculpted EVA sole: The raised sidewall has alternating recessed sections and curved moulded lines, visible in the original side photographs.\n\nFive colour directions: White, Khaki, Coffee, Black/White and All Black are listed in EU36-46 for wholesale colour-size assortments.",
        "company_summary": "Quanzhou Beiqiang Footwear & Apparel Co., Ltd. is a footwear manufacturer based in Quanzhou, Fujian, China. We work with importers, wholesalers, brand owners and e-commerce businesses on wholesale and OEM/ODM footwear projects. From selecting existing styles to developing a design brief, reviewing samples and planning packaging, we help buyers turn their requirements into a clear order plan. Share your product direction and purchasing needs to discuss a suitable cooperation proposal."
